  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "\"Tick-Tock\" Tommy earned his nickname from scavenging the irradiated ruins surrounding Choochy's Chop Shop. His knack for finding ticking time bombs left for dead by rival flocks has both saved and nearly obliterated his own on more than one occasion. No one's quite sure how he survived this long in Subchain City.",
    "class": "Bomb Disposal Expert (Demolitions)",
    "name": "\"Tick-Tock\" Tommy",
    "personality": "Paranoid, resourceful, and darkly humorous. Tommy's always expecting the worst, which makes him a keen strategist, but also a terrible conversationalist. He finds twisted amusement in the irony of his situation.",
